  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's classic G.I Acrylic V-Neck Sweater is the perfect choice for those looking for a rugged and stylish piece of professional apparel. The sweater has been designed to meet standard active-duty specs, and ideal for police officers, public safety, and more. The sweater is made with comfortable acrylic fabric that's perfect for keeping you warm on even the coldest days.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "7047",
  "description": "<p>Rothco's classic G.I Acrylic V-Neck Sweater is the perfect choice for those looking for a rugged and stylish piece of professional apparel. The sweater has been designed to meet standard active-duty specs, and ideal for active-duty personnel, police officers, public safety, and more. The sweater is made with comfortable acrylic fabric that's perfect for keeping you warm on even the coldest days. The shoulder and elbow patches have been reinforced with double needle for enhanced durability. Whether you&rsquo;re going out on the town or heading out on duty, this V-neck style commando sweater is sure to have you looking sharp.&nbsp;</p>",
